			"notes": "# 1.0.0 Release\n\n## Additions \n\n### C418 Discs\n- Blocks\n- Chirp\n- Far\n- Mall \n- Mellohi\n- Stal\n- Strad\n- Ward\n- 11\n- Wait\n\n### Lena Raine Discs\n- Pigstep\n- Otherside\n\n## Obtaining \nAll discs other than Pigstep can be obtained in Dungeon chests or When a skeleton kills a Creeper like cat and 13.\n\nPigstep is obtainable as a 100% chance drop from creeper.\n\n## Compatibility\nRequires [StationAPI 2.0-alpha.1.1](https://modrinth.com/mod/stationapi/version/2.0-alpha.1.1)\n\nCan be configured with [Glass Config API](https://modrinth.com/mod/glass-config-api/version/2.0.2) and [Mod Menu Beta](https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu-beta)\nHas a tab in [Beta Horizons Creative](https://modrinth.com/mod/bh-creative/version/0.4.5)"
		},
